OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fbecome increasingly sporadic through
OL,7,Fthe evening and largely confined to
OL,8,Fhigher ground, with many areas turning
OL,9,Fdry. However, a further band of rain
OL,10,Fwill arrive from the west late, with
OL,11,Fheavier rain expected over the
OL,12,FCheviots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FRain will clear northeastwards
OL,15,Fearly, followed by sunny spells and
OL,16,Fscattered showers. These will become
OL,17,Fincreasingly heavy, widespread and
OL,18,Fpotentially thundery during the late
OL,19,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
