OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fbreezy with sunny spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers, locally heavy. Also breezy on
OL,8,FTuesday, with heavy rain around
OL,9,Flunchtime but sunny spells later.
OL,10,FMostly dry and sunny on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
